| Vehicle | 50–100 triangles |
| Small building | 60–130 triangles |
| Large building | 120–250 triangles |
| Large landmark | 150–300 triangles |

These are triangle budgets, not vertex budgets.

**Do not let Gemini solve the low-poly requirement by simply reducing texture resolution. The actual mesh geometry must be simplified.**

My recommendation is to finish the Outpost first, including all three variations and its complete enemy compatibility testing. Once that is working, use its asset library, geometry standards and optimization settings as the foundation for the remaining four maps.